[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 544 - The Fanatic's damage doubles
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your second main phase. You control Gratuitous Violence (if a creature you control would deal damage, it deals double) and Mogg Fanatic, and have Fling in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-ability-source-doubling | The source of Mogg Fanatic's damage is the Fanatic itself, using last-known information after it is sacrificed (CR 113.7a, 609.7, 608.2h), so Gratuitous Violence doubles it to 2; Fling's damage comes from Fling, a spell, and is not doubled
